Homepage: https://www.armbian.com

Package: armbian-snapshots
Architecture: all
Depends: snapper, btrfs-progs, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Breaks: armbian-hyprland-shell (<< 4.5.0-0+armbian8~)
Replaces: armbian-hyprland-shell (<< 4.5.0-0+armbian8~)
Description: Snapshots of a btrfs root before and after updates
 On a btrfs root, this package sets up snapper at boot. The apt hook of
 snapper then takes a snapshot before and after each package change. The
 newest snapshots stay, from 2 to 10.
 .
 GRUB shows the snapshots in the submenu "Armbian snapshots". A snapshot
 boots with a RAM overlay: changes are lost at reboot. "armbian-snapshot
 restore" makes the booted snapshot the root again. Boards without GRUB
 restore a snapshot by its number.
 .
 On other root file systems the package does nothing.
